      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REBORN DESTINY (2) jumped cleanly from the low draw last start to lead all the way (23.02) at this track in a Grade 5 over 400m. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Can measure up again. KICKER ZOOM (8) goes very well this course and distance starting 10 times for four wins and five minors. Comes off a (22.94) win last time, scoring by a neck in a Grade 4/5 over 400m at this track. Looks well placed here and among the chances. TRAIN OF THOUGHT (3) got the job done again after leading to make it two on end, scoring at Gunnedah over 340m (19.80). Solid formlines coming through his last run. Expecting another bold showing. BLUE CHANELLE (4) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot from this box most recently.",
